							<li>Market monitoring</li>
						</ul>
					</div>
				</div>
			</div>
			
			<div style="text-align: center; margin: 3rem 0;">
				<a href="/eu-readiness-checker" style="display: inline-block; background: #cc0000; color: #000; padding: 1rem 2rem; text-decoration: none; font-weight: 500; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.1em; font-size: 0.9rem; border-radius: 4px;">
					Check EU Readiness &rarr;
				</a>
			</div>
			
			<p style="color: #aaa; line-height: 1.8; margin-bottom: 2rem;">
				Don't wait until 2026 to address these regulations. Start preparing your supply chain now to ensure smooth compliance and avoid potential disruptions. Use our EU Readiness Checker to assess your current compliance status and identify areas for improvement.
			</p>
			
